   "settled_by": "NVIDIA's Form 10-K for fiscal 2027 (guarantees, commitments and contingencies note) and any 8-K or earnings disclosure quantifying the credit support for the additional AI lab's ~2 GW of computing capacity and the minimum-revenue guarantees to cloud partners."
